        "object/measurement definitions and actual coverage",
        "supported findings and conditions with source locators",
        "competing evidence, supported explanations and working hypotheses kept separate",
        "method choices and candidate questions; optional hypotheses when appropriate",
        "reasoned next decision and bibliography/material versions"
      ],
      "template_sections_are_adaptable": true
